rop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aedfe5b4b6e3330e4c4a551314af8c04", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fa302bae/uploads/origins/64db9f9a-359b-445e-8822-d15dad32f6ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aedfe5b4b6e3330e4c4a551314af8c04, https://si.imgix.net/fa302bae/uploads/origins/64db9f9a-359b-445e-8822-d15dad32f6ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0c46eda48a7701e648b568d157dda589 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fa302bae/uploads/origins/64db9f9a-359b-445e-8822-d15dad32f6ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7baf26d2c3f6e276b9d51122316e26d1 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fa302bae/uploads/origins/64db9f9a-359b-445e-8822-d15dad32f6ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=99321c70c852f33c24a1cd312609bb77", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fa302bae/uploads/origins/64db9f9a-359b-445e-8822-d15dad32f6ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=99321c70c852f33c24a1cd312609bb77, https://si.imgix.net/fa302bae/uploads/origins/64db9f9a-359b-445e-8822-d15dad32f6ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cf9eed3fba4762eeb3ff067089be3836 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fa302bae/uploads/origins/64db9f9a-359b-445e-8822-d15dad32f6ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4833ba1c50026ce6523c088977d4ffd6 3x"}, "body": "Hi, I really liked the artwork you previously made for me!\nFor this request, I would like a drawing of the character Tiresias Bazaar and another copy of him facing him. You can use the background reference for the poses.\nThe original Tiresias Bazaar is on the right side, looking towards the left, while a shadow/darker copy of Tiresias is on the left, looking back towards the original Tiresias.\nThe shadow Tiresias looks very angry, with fire-red eyes glowing at night, and looks like a darker silhouette of the original Tiresias. \nThe original Tiresias retains the original bright colors as shown in the character reference sheet, looking back at the shadow Tiresias. The original Tiresias has a stern expression on his face, not as angry as the shadow Tiresias.\nYou can keep the pyramids behind them and the moon in the sky between the two characters.\n\nBackground reference:\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/4cw9o9.jpg\nCharacter reference:\nhttps://x.com/Tiresias_Bazaar/status/1841562986030497932/photo/1", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hatohane_Illust/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3412989, "client_id": 3403949, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5715aa72/uploads/origins/9007ec89-9ad2-4a57-812d-7d365cf40b50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b7d20184431e93f57de909a37226386", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5715aa72/uploads/origins/9007ec89-9ad2-4a57-812d-7d365cf40b50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b7d20184431e93f57de909a37226386, https://si.imgix.net/5715aa72/uploads/origins/9007ec89-9ad2-4a57-812d-7d365cf40b50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b6e0b8cda7b0a9d650ba9533662f232 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5715aa72/uploads/origins/9007ec89-9ad2-4a57-812d-7d365cf40b50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=48d40e0936b16374fc83867b08e76cdb 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5715aa72/uploads/origins/9007ec89-9ad2-4a57-812d-7d365cf40b50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2bb74c8c463c6bd5f8096f1a36600a3d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5715aa72/uploads/origins/9007ec89-9ad2-4a57-812d-7d365cf40b50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2bb74c8c463c6bd5f8096f1a36600a3d, https://si.imgix.net/5715aa72/uploads/origins/9007ec89-9ad2-4a57-812d-7d365cf40b50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=364690c11e2ab340ab92ba75f7cf6691 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5715aa72/uploads/origins/9007ec89-9ad2-4a57-812d-7d365cf40b50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bbb7714ff1fb409653089288c9998b2e 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I saw your artwork on pixiv and I really like it! I would like for you to draw an illustration using the character below.\nThe character's name is Tiresias Bazaar. He is an arrogant knight who traveled far, in search of something he feels he lost.\nFor the illustration, I would like him sitting by a campfire, hunched over. He looks exhausted from traveling a lot.  I would like it if you could draw him in a similar setting to the background/environment. I would like to use the image for my Twitch and Twitter. Thank you so much!\n\nBackground/environment: https://www.reddit.com/r/DigitalArt/comments/15sxn1q/warrior/\nCharacter reference: https://x.com/Tiresias_Bazaar/status/1841562986030497932/photo/1", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hatohane_Illust/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3412989, "client_id": 1800920, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8a0f1b74/uploads/origins/ed0ea682-c468-457b-a845-49d86313f4fc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67cb9b463125f92166b2f20c1326dce8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8a0f1b74/uploads/origins/ed0ea682-c468-457b-a845-49d86313f4fc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&